
 .:[  'minimal' : the smallest [v7] zenka start-up configuration  ]:.

.: globals :.

## v7-zenki itself + the message router, and p7-log : without p7-log the ##
## zenki keep their log buffers in memory, nothing reaches a log file.   ##
## everything else is added per host [ host-config/v7-zenki.cfg :        ##
## v7-zenki.host.zenki.enable = <names> ] or started on demand           ##
  zenki.enabled  =  cube p7-log

  zenki.disabled =

.: zenki :.

